<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <%- include('partials/head') %>
        <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/legal-contact.css">
</head>

<body>
    <%- include('partials/header') %>
        <%- include('partials/flash') %>

            <main class="page-wrapper">
                <!-- HOTSTAR-STYLE HERO BANNER -->
                <section class="legal-hero-card">
                    <div class="legal-hero-backdrop"></div>
                    <div class="legal-overlay-left"></div>
                    <div class="legal-overlay-bottom"></div>

                    <div class="legal-hero-content">
                        <div class="hero-tags">
                            <span class="hotstar-pill secure-pill">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i> DATA GOVERNANCE
                            </span>
                            <span class="hotstar-pill status-pill">
                                <span class="pulsing-dot"></span> EFFECTIVE: AUGUST 2026
                            </span>
                        </div>

                        <h1 class="glitch-title" data-text="PRIVACY POLICY">
                            PRIVACY <span class="gold-text">POLICY</span>
                        </h1>

                        <p class="hero-subtitle">
                            Transparency regarding how ATX Family safeguards your account details, usage metrics, and
                            personal credentials.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </section>

                <!-- POLICY DOCUMENT CONTAINER -->
                <section class="cyber-card content-card">
                    <div class="hud-corner tl"></div>
                    <div class="hud-corner br"></div>

                    <div class="legal-body">
                        <p class="lead-text">
                            Welcome to <strong>ATX Family</strong>. Your privacy and data sovereignty are paramount to
                            us. This Privacy Policy outlines how we collect, store, and protect your information when
                            you access our web application, tournament trackers, and community utilities.
                        </p>

                        <div class="policy-block">
                            <h2><i class="fa-solid fa-database gold-text"></i> 1. Information We Collect</h2>
                            <p>We adhere to strict data minimization principles, collecting only what is essential for
                                gaming functions:</p>
                            <ul class="legal-list">
                                <li><strong>Account Details:</strong> Google OAuth credentials (Display Name, Email
                                    Address, Profile Avatar) during secure login.</li>
                                <li><strong>Custom Identity Data:</strong> Custom community avatars uploaded to
                                    Cloudinary, user bios, Plato handles, and Discord tags.</li>
                                <li><strong>Activity & Telemetry:</strong> Quiz scores, tournament history, and seasonal
                                    XP metrics stored in secure MongoDB clusters.</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>

                        <div class="policy-block">
                            <h2><i class="fa-solid fa-sliders gold-text"></i> 2. How We Use Your Data</h2>
                            <p>Your records are utilized strictly to:</p>
                            <ul class="legal-list">
                                <li>Maintain user authentication, personal profiles, and account state.</li>
                                <li>Render real-time weekly leaderboards, tournament standing brackets, and match
                                    archives.</li>
                                <li>Maintain community safety, verify participant identity, and prevent malicious
                                    evasion of server bans.</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>

                        <div class="policy-block">
                            <h2><i class="fa-solid fa-cloud-arrow-up gold-text"></i> 3. Infrastructure & Third Parties
                            </h2>
                            <p>
                                We operate through vetted enterprise infrastructure including <strong>MongoDB
                                    Atlas</strong> for database clustering, <strong>Cloudinary</strong> for CDN media
                                delivery, and <strong>Google OAuth</strong> for federated sign-in. <strong>We do not
                                    sell, rent, or trade your data to third-party ad networks.</strong>
                            </p>
                        </div>

                        <div class="policy-block">
                            <h2><i class="fa-solid fa-user-xmark gold-text"></i> 4. Data Ownership & Deletion Rights
                            </h2>
                            <p>
                                You retain full ownership of your data. To request the complete purging of your account,
                                scores, or custom images from our systems, submit an account removal request through our
                                Anonymous Reports portal or contact any Senior Administrator.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </section>
            </main>

            <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>

</html>